{
  "_help": [
    "The rooms the game draws for anywhere that isn't on a plan, such as somewhere the game master has just made up. The game master picks the kind, or the game works it out from the name and the words below.",
    "In a layout's plan: # is a wall, @ is where the captain comes in, 0 is the way out, 1 to 8 are where people stand, and a to d are where things go. Any other mark is scenery. Leave room to the right of each number for a name.",
    "floor says which characters are floor, and label says where the room's name goes, as a column and a row counted from 0 at the top left.",
    "things fill in whatever the game master didn't say was there. Restart the game after changing this file."
  ],
